:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=STRSDA.Start SDA (STRSDA)
:P.The Start SDA (STRSDA) command works with the Screen Design Aid, at
its menu or one of its options.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSDA/OPTION'.Option (OPTION)
:P.The option for this command.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SELECT.
:P.The value must be 1, 2, 3.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSDA/SRCFILE'.Source file (SRCFILE)
:P.The source physical file that holds the source member, by name and
library.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSDA/SRCMBR'.Source member (SRCMBR)
:P.The member of the source file that holds the source. *PGM, *MODULE or
*CMD and the like mean the member with the same name as the object being
created.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SELECT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSDA/TSTFILE'.Test display file (TSTFILE)
:P.The test display file for this command.
:PARML.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SELECT.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
